<div class="info-group">
    <div class="title">
        <span class="text"><i>佣金盈利计算示例</i></span>
    </div>
    <p class="text">
        <i>图1:</i> 举例展示如何计算你所推荐的玩家负盈利获得佣金盈利
    </p>
    @{ Html.RenderPartial("~/Views/CommissionStructure/_ExampleTable.cshtml"); }
    <p class="text">
        <i>图2:</i> 举例展示如何计算从你所推荐的下线合营伙伴（与他们再推荐的下线合营伙伴）的佣金盈利。
    </p>
    <div class="img-support" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 15px auto;">
        <img class="img-responsive" src="~/www/build/styles/Images/revenue-share-structure/revenue_share_hierarchy-cn.png" />
    </div>
    <p class="text">
        您下线合营伙伴的佣金盈利计算:
    </p>
    <div style="padding-left: 30px;">
        <p class="text">
            = [B1+ ((C1 + C2) * 10%)]*10% + [B2 * 10%]
        </p>
        <p class="text">
            = [0 + (50,000 + 30,000) * 10%)]*10% + [70,000 * 10%]
        </p>
        <p class="text">
            = 7,800 VND
        </p>
    </div>
    <p class="text">
        <strong>=></strong> 您当月佣金盈利为: 58,050 + 7,800 = <strong>65,850 VND</strong>
    </p>
</div>
